    "title": "高度自定义/交互 Interactive Custom 东方 帕秋莉 支持快捷方式 4K touhou Patchouli Knowledge パチュリー",
    "description": "壁纸制作：残月曦萧\n原画师：试作型拾九\n\n首先非常感谢您喜欢我的壁纸并且看到这段话。不过制作壁纸不易，故在此声明：本人壁纸严禁未经允许的商用和转载至其他平台行为。如果您是壁纸推荐博主，或者想转载壁纸，使用壁纸进行宣传，请务必在醒目处注明作者或艾特我：残月曦萧。同时，如您想通过网盘等渠道将我的壁纸分享给他人，请务必注意命名格式：命名加好作者前缀名,如将mpkg命名格式统一为“残月曦萧——XXX“。有条件可以单独开一作者分区，谢谢\n\n这是我首个发布的大型壁纸，从开始制作、学习到完成，断断续续持续了一年。由于它有着大量的实验性功能，以及完全由木偶动画等实时效果制作，因此使用完全地使用它的全部功能对性能要求相当的高。如果出现卡顿，在进行反馈之前，我强烈建议试试将帧率降至30~24，因为该壁纸的运动幅度不大，所以这真的没有想象中那么糟糕、它仍能提供相当不错的流畅性和平衡的性能开销\n\n如果有建议或翻译问题，可以留言或是到我的bilibili账号进行反馈\n最后，如果您对壁纸满意，也希望能给它一个好评让更多人看到，谢谢！\n\nFirst and foremost, thank you so much for enjoying my wallpaper and taking the time to read this. However, creating wallpapers is no easy task, so I must state clearly: unauthorized commercial use and reposting of my work to other platforms are strictly prohibited.\n\nIf you are a content creator or wish to share this wallpaper for promotional purposes, please be sure to clearly credit me as the author or tag me (@残月曦萧) in a prominent place. Additionally, if you plan to share my wallpaper via cloud storage or other channels, please pay attention to the file naming format: add my name as a prefix, for example, naming files uniformly as Canyue Xixiao——XXX. If possible, creating a dedicated folder for the author would be greatly appreciated. Thank you!\n\nThis is my first large-scale wallpaper release. From start to finish—learning, creating, and polishing—it took me nearly a year, albeit intermittently. Due to its extensive experimental features and real-time effects like puppet animation, this wallpaper is quite performance-intensive. If you experience stuttering, I strongly recommend trying to lower the frame rate to 30–24 FPS before reporting any issues. Since the motion in this wallpaper is relatively subtle, this adjustment isn't as detrimental as it might seem—it still offers a smooth experience while balancing performance demands.\n\nIf you have any suggestions or encounter translation issues, feel free to leave a comment or reach out to me via my Bilibili comment section.\n\nLastly, if you're satisfied with this wallpaper, I’d truly appreciate it if you could leave a positive review to help more people discover it. Thank you!\n\n2025.10.31   V1.0：\n1.新增支持自定义快捷方式图标，与相关用户属性32个\n2.新增常驻控制台文字动态光效与渐变色\n3.优化了大量用户属性命名，并增加了部分说明\n4.重制了触摸效果并改为悬停触发、点击眨眼\n5.优化了镜头控制，增加了偏移选项\n6.更改了部分用户属性默认值\n7.修复了眨眼效果、与触摸时眨眼错误的问题\n8.修复了音频播放时常驻控制台错误显示的BUG与收藏键消失的BUG\n9.修复了音频控制台未开启时切歌会触发切换动画的BUG\n2025.11.4   V1.1：\n1.修复了部分问题",
